Notes for next week:
- Studio now shows "Continue to post? ... Post now" if you click Schedule before "Content check lite" finishes (~5-10 min).
  Click Cancel, wait for "No issues found", then click Schedule again. Never click that "Post now".
- ElevenLabs audio now comes from elevenlabsusercontent.com (also blocked in the container). Chrome blocks a 2nd
  automatic download from that site; fetch all clips from an elevenlabs.io tab (CORS ok) and download them as ONE
  concatenated .bin, then split by byte sizes in the container.
- Scroll the page up ~3 ticks before opening the date/time pickers so they open fully (they open upward).
- 4 builds in parallel take ~30 min on the 2-core container.
